<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-WORLD YOUTH CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD YOUTH CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the world youth</p>
<p>soccer championship on Monday:</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>In Kuantan: Japan 3 Paraguay 3 (halftime 2-2)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Japan - Jojo 31, Hiroyama 45, Yanagisawa 60</p>
<p>Paraguay - Caceres 17, Dasilva 38, Samdio 75</p>
<p>Spain 4 Costa Rica 0</p>
<p>Halftime: Spain 3-0</p>
<p>Scorers</p>
<p>Spain -- Alberto Rivera Pizzaro 3, David Albelda Aliques 23,</p>
<p>Francisco Farinos 24, Diego Ribera Ramirez 75</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p>Australia 4 Argentina 3</p>
<p>Halftime: Australia 2-1</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Australia -- Kostas Salapasidis 40, 41, 54, 90</p>
<p>Argentina -- Bernardo Romeo 7, Diego Placente 69, Roman</p>
<p>Riquelme 88.</p>
<p>Canada 2 Hungary 1</p>
<p>Halftime 1-1</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Canada -- Dwayne DeRosario 7, Steve Kindel 64</p>
<p>Hungary -- Szili Ittila 4</p>
